(5802270, 845065, 105457, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, very well executed. It deserves a tighter crop, but it is very imaginative.</td>', 'Very good idea, very well executed. It deserves a tighter crop, but it is very imaginative.', '2010-01-08 09:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
