(5802309, 844631, 112107, '<td valign="top">Gave it an 8* just because of two small anoyances:<br/>1) noise artifacts on top<br/>(edit) changed my vote to 9* because on a profiled monitor even though the noise is there, is almost unnoticeable<br/>2) framing could improve IMHO if the left bottom corner included the beach.<br/>Otherwise it''s almost as far as possible from a Rodchenko but I give it 3 thumbs up for the angle! :)</td>', 'Gave it an 8* just because of two small anoyances:1) noise artifacts on top(edit) changed my vote to 9* because on a profiled monitor even though the noise is there, is almost unnoticeable2) framing could improve IMHO if the left bottom corner included the beach.Otherwise it''s almost as far as possible from a Rodchenko but I give it 3 thumbs up for the angle! :)', '2010-01-08 10:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
