(5806492, 843579, 49788, '<td valign="top">Nice framing of the moon with the grass and I like the diagonal through the image. Unfortunately, the image looks over processed: it''s perhaps oversharpened, and there''s a weird black halo around the moon.</td>', 'Nice framing of the moon with the grass and I like the diagonal through the image. Unfortunately, the image looks over processed: it''s perhaps oversharpened, and there''s a weird black halo around the moon.', '2010-01-11 17:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5806493, 844916, 49788, '<td valign="top">Really interesting to see the moon through light green. A clever shot. I like it.</td>', 'Really interesting to see the moon through light green. A clever shot. I like it.', '2010-01-11 17:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5806498, 844631, 49788, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors in the sky and upper right of the house; interesting subject; good framing of the subject and placement of the moon. Would have been amazing if you had a person walking out there or doing something interesting. I wish they weren''t just standing around. Overall a very good photo.</td>', 'Wonderful colors in the sky and upper right of the house; interesting subject; good framing of the subject and placement of the moon. Would have been amazing if you had a person walking out there or doing something interesting. I wish they weren''t just standing around. Overall a very good photo.', '2010-01-11 17:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5806500, 843468, 49788, '<td valign="top">Nice image. The brown / gray towns in the fog / clouds are an interesting contrast with the sharp black silhouette. Clear picture of the moon. Would have been nice  if the sky were less noisy -- you can see it even in this small size.</td>', 'Nice image. The brown / gray towns in the fog / clouds are an interesting contrast with the sharp black silhouette. Clear picture of the moon. Would have been nice  if the sky were less noisy -- you can see it even in this small size.', '2010-01-11 17:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5806502, 844180, 49788, '<td valign="top">Nice framing of the moon and detail in the tree branches. Like the converging lines. Wish the moon weren''t blown out, and the ground were more interesting.</td>', 'Nice framing of the moon and detail in the tree branches. Like the converging lines. Wish the moon weren''t blown out, and the ground were more interesting.', '2010-01-11 17:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5806565, 844167, 2158, '<td valign="top">The bottom half is really beautiful, but that big white blob in the sky really bothers  me.  Cropped to a panoramic, it would look pretty good.</td>', 'The bottom half is really beautiful, but that big white blob in the sky really bothers  me.  Cropped to a panoramic, it would look pretty good.', '2010-01-11 18:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5806731, 844217, 68947, '<td valign="top">ROFL!!!</td>', 'ROFL!!!', '2010-01-11 21:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5806732, 843979, 68947, '<td valign="top">HOLY CROW!!!  Where were you...in a space ship to get this shot? LOL  GREAT JOB!!!</td>', 'HOLY CROW!!!  Where were you...in a space ship to get this shot? LOL  GREAT JOB!!!', '2010-01-11 21:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
