(5808507, 844709, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> I predict Red Ribbon for this shot.  Pretty easy prediction actually.  :-)  I love the scene overall.  The comp is great.  Only thing that''s keeping this a 9 instead of a 10 is the tonal range.  I''d like to see more coverage on the lower end in the blacks.  Great shot overall!  Congrats. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Love it when predictions are this easy.  :-D  Wonderful shot and well deserving of a shiny new ribbon!</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: I predict Red Ribbon for this shot.  Pretty easy prediction actually.  :-)  I love the scene overall.  The comp is great.  Only thing that''s keeping this a 9 instead of a 10 is the tonal range.  I''d like to see more coverage on the lower end in the blacks.  Great shot overall!  Congrats.  Love it when predictions are this easy.  :-D  Wonderful shot and well deserving of a shiny new ribbon!', '2010-01-13 00:11:42.000000', NULL, 0),
