(5808834, 844968, 105466, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and kind comments.<br/>I took this picture in the morning with the sun just below the horizon, facing in the opposite direction. The old church was built in northern Iceland in 1842, taken down in 1959 and then rebuilt in the Reykjavík city museum village in 1961-''62. It is a popular wedding church with foreign tourists who come to visit.</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and kind comments.I took this picture in the morning with the sun just below the horizon, facing in the opposite direction. The old church was built in northern Iceland in 1842, taken down in 1959 and then rebuilt in the Reykjavík city museum village in 1961-''62. It is a popular wedding church with foreign tourists who come to visit.', '2010-01-13 02:26:54.000000', NULL, 0),
