(5811348, 845020, 63398, '<td valign="top">You done did it, got the brown! Congrats, I guess! LOL!!! I actually find this to be more visually pleasing and less obtuse than your usual efforts.....sorry.....8&gt;)</td>', 'You done did it, got the brown! Congrats, I guess! LOL!!! I actually find this to be more visually pleasing and less obtuse than your usual efforts.....sorry.....8>)', '2010-01-14 07:55:29.000000', NULL, 0),
